# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# This one is deliberate. It carries Android's public debug credentials, so it
# is not a secret, and it exists only so the SHA-1 that Google Sign-In is
# registered against stays the same on every machine and CI run. It is NOT an
# upload key: publishing on Play needs a real, private one that never lands here.
!/app/prayer-sheet.keystore
